  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{褒|ほ}める (praise X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing or repeated action. {褒|ほ}めている = 'is praising.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{褒|ほ}める (praise someone)\n- {褒|ほ}められる (be praised—passive)\n- {褒|ほ}めて⟦{育|そだ}てる→育てる：01235_sodateru⟧ (raise with praise)\n- {褒|ほ}め⟦{言葉|ことば}→言葉：02880_kotoba⟧ (compliment, words of praise)\n- お⟦{世辞|せじ}→世辞：15102_seji⟧で{褒|ほ}める (flatter)\n\nOPPOSITE: ⟦{叱|しか}る→叱る：01202_shikaru⟧ (to scold)\n\nKANJI NOTE: Can also be written as {誉|ほ}める, but {褒|ほ}める is more common.\n\nREGISTER: Neutral.",
